<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-22T22:33:00.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed an NDC supporter in Enugu during a campaign attack and a pastor was found dead after abduction in Plateau, while bandits in Kaduna continue to hold a widow, her son and a newborn captive three weeks after kidnapping. Electricity workers halted service in Makurdi after an alleged attack, and bandits ambushed a vehicle in Sokoto, killing a teacher and two others. A-Q, a Nigerian rapper, survived a machete attack in Ghana and recounted the incident. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPUGFsYVVoWHRmc1lIR2trNlg5MWxIcnVoYU1fWG1yS3JiSkEtUmlRdmhsbm5FZ3JCdkdEN0s5MEFOLUtRb3lzYVVPbUJObUpUYWd3dXdKX19LbkEwOFlUNE9WQ0tFYk9zRFVMNGYtZFpWZnQ4TXlqdjVVeVBKeUYzZFJheDVjMFN0bkIzUGxXbFZ0ZEkxZVljMGk5VG1HWUt1aWVWUVFJWGF2OU9rWGI2SHRpNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQelVQaDFIUExFckpWZHViZURoYzRncWtlSWJZUC01d2Z5S3JfSEw3dzZ4eTZjdjR4VXFFcFVsSHRRc0hsZ3N4WWN2cU50YjMwaWhnbE1oSkhIUy1ZYXNIdHJhOUFhc2dibTZVSWNrRU5rYTk4NzE5WUo2X184WGM4YTgyQlB1Z2ZBVXMwS3p0Y0VCdFA0R2xQdkg0Wkp3V3ppQU4tVEQ5SWtGQWJDUTJ6Tk1GUHhBVWgz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE12OVY5YVluZFBkUDh1eE9IcjJ4djlVZzZiRnM3ZE14MFFfWmItaHBmdnRWOTZNd1dsMzIwR1J1c05IbUFzdTVwYU5TYVhrSV9fZDFGU1A2NTFlTjBfaWhZYlhGbVhpQVFGeWVPcWgyVnVfR0JxSUdfVF9IV0JweGtDNEdteGlHN1JaWl9IMkF0ZERXNVJuTXNoZkxZRUVxMUdMWHdBWjZmX0ZEUVFGMkxjM01nVlhZbWpTOUxORlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQWTVxbENNXzZramEzQkhxaFlDOVYtaEVjeEVadkJyU0lEMEY4anpvYmhxS1RJNkViWHpXYS1Wblpmc0pibGFJdERDRVRGV2x6X2F6MWRacUhTMEVfTnF1cjJIMloyNWc3OWRYWDVFam93UmJyWEs3ZkNwSUtEMzJlQkk4QTBFbG5FTkVVLW1aNEU2TEJwNndqaTl3OEI?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new